<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/16e5f35e4e27> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A worker at a Volkswagen factory in Germany has died, after a robot grabbed him and crushed him against a metal plate." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "244" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1b182ec54aeb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "VW spokesman Heiko Hillwing says the incident was likely caused by a human error, and not because of faulty programming in the robot." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "247" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/22a6f1e1bb92> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "He was working as part of a team of contractors installing the robot when it grabbed him, according to the German car manufacturer." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "249" .

