    airo:evidenceText "The incident occurred on Monday as a Volkswagen factory in Baunatal, Hesse, when the 21-year-old man from another company was working on assembling the robot for a new electric motor production line." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "248" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/27936b9e6ad2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A 22-year-old German worker has died after an accident involving a robot in a Volkswagen production plant in the town of Baunatal, approximately 100 km north of Frankfurt." ;
