<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0269c0a03b1b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The first recorded robot-related death took place in 1971, at a Ford car production line in Michigan." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "250" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/059217180870> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Prosecutors, who are looking into how the accident occurred, have yet to decide whether charges will be brought against anyone involved." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "261" .

